      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Local chemical arrangements and short-range order create heterogeneous energy barriers to dislocation motion.",
